# Third-party components

No code is added. The add-on uses FreeCAD's BIM (Arch_Structure, Arch_Stairs, Arch_Fence,
Arch_Panel_Sheet, profiles), TechDraw, Spreadsheet, Material, Help and Draft workbenches
through their Python API (LGPL-2.1-or-later, shipped with FreeCAD).

Data: the libraries under `Resources/libraries/` carry `source` and `data_license` per file or entry.
The Material cards under `Resources/Materials/` are original (CC0-1.0).
